 Call","r":[0.1093,0.2463,0.0472,0.0378],"k":"w"},{"n":"Reliquary of Truth","r":[0.1093,0.307,0.0472,0.0378],"k":"w"},{"n":"Sacrificial Jade","r":[0.1093,0.3678,0.0472,0.0378],"k":"w"},{"n":"Waveriding Whirl","r":[0.1093,0.4359,0.0472,0.0378],"k":"w"},{"n":"Silken Moon's Serenade","r":[0.5231,0.2537,0.0472,0.0378],"k":"a"},{"n":"Aubade of Morningstar and Moon","r":[0.5231,0.3293,0.0472,0.0378],"k":"a"},{"n":"Tenacity of the Millelith","r":[0.5231,0.4048,0.0472,0.0378],"k":"a"},{"n":"Columbina","r":[0.0815,0.5533,0.037,0.0296]},{"n":"Flins","r":[0.1259,0.5533,0.037,0.0296]},{"n":"Ineffa","r":[0.1704,0.5533,0.037,0.0296]},{"n":"Sucrose","r":[0.2148,0.5533,0.037,0.0296]},{"n":"Columbina","r":[0.0815,0.6141,0.037,0.0296]},{"n":"Nefer","r":[0.1259,0.6141,0.037,0.0296]},{"n":"Lauma","r":[0.1704,0.6141,0.037,0.0296]},{"n":"Sucrose","r":[0.2148,0.6141,0.037,0.0296]},{"n":"Columbina","r":[0.0815,0.6748,0.037,0.0296]},{"n":"Zibai","r":[0.1259,0.6748,0.037,0.0296]},{"n":"Linnea","r":[0.1704,0.6748,0.037,0.0296]},{"n":"Illuga","r":[0.2148,0.6748,0.037,0.0296]},{"n":"Columbina","r":[0.0815,0.7289,0.037,0.0296]},{"n":"Fischl","r":[0.1259,0.7289,0.037,0.0296]},{"n":"Aino","r":[0.1704,0.7289,0.037,0.0296]},{"n":"Sucrose","r":[0.2148,0.7289,0.037,0.0296]}]}]}},"thumb":"content/genshin/builds/columbina/261111-224833/en-1.t.webp","why":{"w":[{"name":"Nocturne's Curtain Call","text":"Signature CD, HP and Energy support with bonuses to Lunar reaction damage."},{"name":"Reliquary of Truth","text":"Strong for an on-field Lunar-Bloom build; its brief CRIT passive is harder to use off-field. Primarily for on-field Columbina."},{"name":"Sacrificial Jade","text":"Strong off-field CR, HP and EM; avoid CR overcap and check Burst Energy needs."},{"name":"Waveriding Whirl","text":"ER-oriented catalyst for supporting Burst uptime; its on-field Normal Attack effects have limited value. Energy utility over personal damage."},{"name":"Surf's Up","text":"CD and HP for personal damage; its Normal Attack passive is less useful off-field."},{"name":"Prototype Amber","text":"Craftable HP, Energy refund and healing after Burst."},{"name":"Favonius Codex","text":"ER and team particles on CRIT; useful when Energy is tight."},{"name":"Thrilling Tales of Dragon Slayers","text":"Gives the next active ATK-scaling ally an ATK buff; sacrifices Columbina’s own damage. Only when the next carry benefits from ATK."}],"a":[{"names":["Silken Moon's Serenade"],"text":"ER and team Lunar reaction buffs. Use when the set is not already covered.","stats":"HP%/ER · HP% · CR/CD"},{"names":["Aubade of Morningstar and Moon"],"text":"Boosts her personal Lunar damage when another teammate handles Silken Moon.","stats":"HP%/ER · HP% · CR/CD"},{"names":["Tenacity of the Millelith"],"text":"HP plus team ATK when her Skill hits. Niche if supporting an ATK carry and Lunar sets are covered.","stats":"ER / HP% · HP% · CR/CD"}],"t":[{"name":"Watt the Flins","members":["Columbina","Flins","Ineffa","Sucrose"],"text":"Flins drives Lunar-Charged damage while Ineffa applies Electro. Columbina provides Hydro and Lunar buffs; Sucrose groups and reduces RES.","roles":["Hydro Support","DPS","Sub DPS","Support"]},{"name":"Bloom Goes the Dynamite","members":["Columbina","Nefer","Lauma","Sucrose"],"text":"Nefer drives Lunar-Bloom with Lauma’s Dendro support. Columbina supplies Hydro and Lunar buffs, while Sucrose groups enemies.","roles":["Hydro Support","DPS","Sub DPS","Support"]},{"name":"Moon Over Matter","members":["Columbina","Zibai","Linnea","Illuga"],"text":"Zibai deals Geo damage with Lunar-Crystallize enabled by Columbina’s Hydro. Linnea and Illuga add support and damage.","roles":["Hydro Support","DPS","Sub DPS","Support"]},{"name":"MOONIMUM WAGE","members":["Columbina","Fischl","Aino","Sucrose"],"text":"Columbina and Aino apply Hydro, Fischl supplies Electro, and Sucrose groups enemies and boosts reaction damage.","roles":["Hydro Support","DPS","Sub DPS","Support"]}],"v":"Lunar Team Buffer: Prioritize Lunar team buffs and Hydro application over personal damage.\nOff-field Lunar Damage: Maximize Columbina’s own Lunar reaction damage with a dedicated damage set.\nBudget Utility: Trade some personal damage for Energy, healing, or accessible buffs.","n":4},"seo":{"roles":["Support / Sub DPS"],"about":"Columbina provides off-field Hydro and supports Lunar-Charged, Lunar-Bloom, and Lunar-Crystallize teams. She can focus on team buffs or personal Lunar damage, depending on artifacts and teammates.","pros":["Enables Lunar Reactions","Great Hydro application","Strong off-field damage","Powerful team buffs"],"cons":["High ER needs","Lunar-team reliant","Wants specific teammates","Lower value outside Lunar"],"weapons":["Nocturne's Curtain Call","Reliquary of Truth","Sacrificial Jade","Waveriding Whirl","Surf's Up","Prototype Amber","Favonius Codex","Thrilling Tales of Dragon Slayers"],"arts":[{"sets":["Silken Moon's Serenade"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Support"},{"sets":["Aubade of Morningstar and Moon"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Support"},{"sets":["Tenacity of the Millelith"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Support"}],"main":["HP% / ER","HP%","CR / CD"],"stats":["HP: 30K–35K+","CR: 60–70%","CD: 140–200%+","ER: Team-based"],"vars":[{"title":"Lunar Team Buffer","role":"Off-field Support","weapons":["Nocturne's Curtain Call","Prototype Amber","Favonius Codex"],"arts":[{"sets":["Silken Moon's Serenade"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"Build enough ER for reliable Burst use, then HP and CRIT.","teams":"Lunar reaction team; no duplicate Silken Moon holder.","when":"Prioritize Lunar team buffs and Hydro application over personal damage.","cond":"Energy needs are higher when solo Hydro","notes":"","pre":false},{"title":"Off-field Lunar Damage","role":"Off-field DPS","weapons":["Nocturne's Curtain Call","Sacrificial Jade","Reliquary of Truth"],"arts":[{"sets":["Aubade of Morningstar and Moon"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"HP% / HP% / CRIT; balance ER and CR.","teams":"Another character uses Silken Moon.","when":"Maximize Columbina’s own Lunar reaction damage with a dedicated damage set.","cond":"Best when another teammate carries Silken Moon and Lunar reactions are frequent.","notes":"","pre":false},{"title":"Budget Utility","role":"Off-field Support","weapons":["Prototype Amber","Favonius Codex","Thrilling Tales of Dragon Slayers"],"arts":[{"sets":["Silken Moon's Serenade"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"ER and HP first; CR for Favonius.","teams":"Prototype Amber helps sustain; TTDS needs an ATK carry.","when":"Trade some personal damage for Energy, healing, or accessible buffs.","cond":"TTDS is not useful for every Lunar DPS","notes":"","pre":false}],"mats":["Varunada Lazurite Sliver","Varunada Lazurite Fragment","Varunada Lazurite Chunk","Varunada Lazurite Gemstone","Radiant Antler","Teachings of Moonlight","Guide to Moonlight","Philosophies of Moonlight","Slime Condensate","Slime Secretions","Slime Concentrate","Winter Icelea","Mask of the Virtuous Doctor","Crown of Insight","Mora","Hero's Wit"],"talents":[{"name":"Normal Attack","pri":"Level 1+"},{"name":"Elemental Skill","pri":"Level 9+"},{"name":"Elemental Burst","pri":"Level 9+"}],"teams":[{"name":"Watt the Flins","members":["Columbina","Flins","Ineffa","Sucrose"]},{"name":"Bloom Goes the Dynamite","members":["Columbina","Nefer","Lauma","Sucrose"]},{"name":"Moon Over Matter","members":["Columbina","Zibai","Linnea","Illuga"]},{"name":"MOONIMUM WAGE","members":["Columbina","Fischl","Aino","Sucrose"]}]}}],"title":"Columbina","el":"Hydro"}